title: Org workspace
description: Everything a signed-in member sees. An org's projects, members, and billing, and inside a project, its document tree, whiteboards, and pages.
connects:
  - to: src/components/tree
    label: project tree
  - to: src/components/whiteboard
    label: whiteboard pages
  - to: src/components/editor
    label: text pages
  - to: src/lib/github
    label: Import from GitHub
  - to: src/lib/supabase
    label: queries as the member
    description: Pages and server actions query Supabase with the member's session. A viewer who calls an editor's action is refused by the database, not only by the interface.
